# Drivers > Remove MIDI Mapper: ARCH311_REF_INI=1 tools/run-cp-test.sh apps/control/tests/drivers-remmap.w16 OUT Drivers
# Same keys as arch311-ref/scn/drivers-remmap.scn: Remove, Yes, "The MIDI Mapper driver has been
# removed..." (Don't Restart Now), the list without it, close
# regress: ARCH311_REF_INI=1 sh tools/run-cp-test.sh "$TEST" "$OUT" Drivers
# The confirmation is a MessageBox: libw16's is not yet USER's layout (the port of USER's MessageBox,
# seg1:9B91, is on the International branch; with it this frame differs only in the exclamation icon's
# image). Enable by turning "pending-compare:" into "compare:" once it is on dev:
# pending-compare: drivers-remmap/03.png 01-confirm.png active ignore 320 239 333 261
# compare: drivers-remmap/04.png 02-restart.png active ignore 320 239 333 261
# compare: drivers-remmap/05.png 03-removed.png active ignore 320 239 333 261
# ini: SYSTEM.INI drivers midimapper=
# ini: SYSTEM.INI drivers timer=timer.drv
# ini: CONTROL.INI drivers.desc midimap.drv=
# ini: CONTROL.INI drivers.desc timer.drv=Timer
sleep 900
key tab
key tab
key tab
key space
sleep 500
shot shots/01-confirm.png
key y
sleep 500
shot shots/02-restart.png
key esc
sleep 400
shot shots/03-removed.png
key esc
sleep 300
shot shots/04-closed.png
quit
